icant (p<0.05 by two-tailed t-tests).\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 1\", \"q\": \"A t-test was conducted to compare the prevalence estimates between adults with active epilepsy and without epilepsy\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}